#. English: "Low latency"
msgid "UI_MENU_LOW_LATENCY"
msgstr ""

#. English: "Starts each frame as late as it can still be shown on time, so the picture answers the controls sooner. Uses NVIDIA Reflex or AMD Anti-Lag 2 when the driver offers them, the port's own timing otherwise. Boost: with Reflex the GPU also keeps its clocks up; otherwise shorter waits, with a dropped frame now and then."
msgid "UI_MENU_LOW_LATENCY_DESC"
msgstr ""

